&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; harpon de ma&#238;tre, +12/+7 (1d8+6/&#215;3) et 2 sabots, +5 (1d6+2)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Distance&lt;/b&gt; harpon de ma&#238;tre, +11 (1d8+4/&#215;3) ou javeline, +9/+4 (1d6+4)
